@baseUrl = localhost:25560


### 1. 获取认证 Token (如果有登录接口的话，先换取 Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}




### 2. 获取项目元数据 (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 3. 创建项目元数据 (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Laboratory animal experiment",
  "category": "animal",
  "tags": ["animal", "experiment", "veterinary"],
  "dataSource": "mysql"
}


### 4. 更新项目元数据 (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated description",
  "category": "updated",
  "tags": ["animal", "updated"],
  "dataSource": "yaml"
}


### 5. 删除项目元数据 (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 6. 测试未授权访问 (应返回 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/1/metadata